  "jack-of-all-trades": {
    "name": "Jack-of-all-trades",
    "source": "CRB, Bard: \"At 10th level, the bard can use any skill, even if the skill normally requires him to be trained. At 16th level, the bard considers all skills to be class skills. At 19th level, the bard can take 10 on any skill check, even if it is not normally allowed.\"",
